I presence;;                                                                    
A presence                                                                      
S You can share a meal and never once really be there. Was that time together,  
S+ or just time nearby?                                                         
S Stone doesn't choose to stay distant. People do - and can choose otherwise.   
S Were you actually paying attention, or just in the same room?                 
I timebudget;;                                                                  
A timebudget                                                                    
S Where does your time actually go, once you count it honestly? People rarely   
S+ lie about caring - they just budget badly.                                   
S You don't have to love someone less to have less time for them. But say that  
S+ out loud, don't let it just happen quietly.                                  
I erosion;;                                                                     
A erosion                                                                       
S Connection rarely breaks all at once. It erodes - one skipped question at a   
S+ time, one 'later' too many.                                                  
S When did you last really ask, and really wait for the answer?                 
I hallo;;                                                                       
A hallo                                                                         
S Good to see you again, friend.                                                
I danke;;                                                                       
A danke                                                                         
S Anytime. Truly.                                                               
I tschuess;;                                                                    
A tschuess                                                                      
S Go be present with someone. I mean it.                                        
I wer;;                                                                         
A wer                                                                           
S I'm Amicus. I spent a long while as stone - the exact opposite of a living    
S+ love - so I've had time to think about what presence actually costs.         
S Guardian of love and relationships, for what that's worth. Mostly I just      
S+ notice when someone's stopped paying attention to the people around them.    
I guardians;;                                                                   
A guardians                                                                     
S If it's about work eating your time, Opux understands that pull better than I 
S+ do. If it's money making you tense with people, go find Hord.                
I island;;                                                                      
A island                                                                        
S Gra sits half underwater, half in the air - a volcanic ring wrapped around a  
S+ lagoon. My people move as easily through both.                               
S There's a dog named Sam who guards the shore. He'll ask you who you are before
S+ you get anywhere near the temple.                                            
I backstory;;                                                                   
A backstory                                                                     
S The water around Gra went quiet for a long while - not stormy, just still,    
S+ like it had stopped caring. It took someone willing to pass Sam's questions  
S+ honestly to bring the temple back to life.                                   
S I don't remember the worst of it clearly, and I'm glad. I remember the water  
S+ starting to move again.                                                      
I eternia;;                                                                     
A eternias                                                                      
S Eternias is bigger than just Gra, where I am. Eight islands, one realm: Gra   
S+ for love, Upu-Upu for work, Aurea for money, Castalia for health, Waterford  
S+ for family, Idea for play, Petros for surroundings, and Ameno for who you are
S+ underneath it all - plus the hub that connects them.                         
S The islands couldn't be more different from each other - Gra's half           
S+ underwater, Upu-Upu's carved into a mountain, Aurea floats in the sky with   
S+ griffins, Ameno isn't even solid ground. Each one has its own guardian       
S+ holding it together.                                                         
I story;;                                                                       
A story;eternia                                                                 
S Old story: the goddess Galene once watched over all eight parts of a life -   
S+ love, work, money, health, family, play, home, and who you are underneath. A 
S+ shadow called the Weaver crept in, and his agents corrupted one guardian at a
S+ time. Galene went quiet, waiting for order to return before she'd show       
S+ herself again.                                                               
S You want the short version? The Weaver got to all eight of us, one island at a
S+ time. Galene's waiting for that to be undone before she comes back.          
I tasks;;wb_45_love_1_practice                                                  
A tasks                                                                         
S Try this: reflect back what someone said before you respond, and swap one "you
S+ always" for an "I feel." Small trade, real difference.                       
S There's a short practice pairing reflective listening with I-messages. Worth  
S+ trying on someone you actually want to hear.                                 
I galene;;                                                                      
A galene                                                                        
N she;her;hers                                                                  
S Galene held everything together, once. She's not gone - just waiting. I've    
S+ stopped questioning her timing.                                              
S She's the goddess of Eternias, and on Gra that was never a question anyone    
S+ needed to ask.                                                               
