I legend;;                                                                      
A legend_word;eternia                                                           
T 1;Every child on Gra learns it.                                               
T 2;There is - the Legend of Eternias. It tells how this realm came to be as a  
T+ mirror of the mortal world, made from what people dream and hope for; how    
T+ Galene kept its seas calm with the guardians she had chosen, in an age when  
T+ the light never seemed to fade; and how, when hearts turned cold and love    
T+ wore thin, something dark got in and took the guardians one by one, breaking 
T+ what they carried. It ends on a promise rather than a loss: someone mortal,  
T+ woken here, will stand up and bring the light back. And every telling ends by
T+ asking whether that someone might be you.                                    
T 3;There's a song of it, if you'd rather hear it sung.                         
